{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】10月23日now早晨新聞重點</p>\n<p>【七級地震】西藏那曲市發生7級地震，已造成16人死亡。</p>\n<p>【作戰準備】伊朗軍方指德黑蘭無人機技術成熟，已做好應對非對稱戰爭的準備。</p>\n<p>【科技股拖累】美國股市受科技股拖累，納指收市跌逾百分之2，道指低開再急挫之後回穩。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:19:29.134506+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:07:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:18:11.480830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:18:11.480830+00:00","content_hash":"9a88869b56917ec19e94fffb13b2da63835f78608193674949245cc869963767","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}